{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "en",
  "language_raw": "English",
  "source": "message/dat/English/script/team_0160.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/English/script/team_0160.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_01",
      "hash64": "40212BBBE39C564C",
      "text": "Now then, Miss Penny—and each of you young\\nbosses, as well.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_02",
      "hash64": "40212EBBE39C5B65",
      "text": "On behalf of the academy, I have something I\\nwould like to say to Team Star.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_03",
      "hash64": "40212DBBE39C59B2",
      "text": "You all have...my sincerest apologies.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "team_0160_botan_01",
      "hash64": "1B1193CD8DCB5C15",
      "text": "...Come again?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_04",
      "hash64": "402128BBE39C5133",
      "text": "As director of the academy, I let you down. My\\nhandling of your situation was a dismal failure...[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "team_0160_botan_02",
      "hash64": "1B1190CD8DCB56FC",
      "text": "Wha—? I still don’t... I mean... Why?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_05",
      "hash64": "402127BBE39C4F80",
      "text": "You all told me about your reasons for forming\\nTeam Star and about your subsequent actions.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_06",
      "hash64": "40212ABBE39C5499",
      "text": "Ever since my first days as director, all I’ve ever\\nexperienced of the academy is an environment\\r\\nblessedly free from bullying.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_07",
      "hash64": "402129BBE39C52E6",
      "text": "But I now know this peace was built on the backs\\nof your hurt and anger—and, of course, your\\r\\nimmense courage in putting things to right.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_08",
      "hash64": "402134BBE39C6597",
      "text": "And so, I’ll get straight to the conclusion.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_09",
      "hash64": "402133BBE39C63E4",
      "text": "The academy’s order for Team Star to disband\\nand my threat to expel those who did not obey...\\r\\nare hereby revoked![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "team_0160_aku_03",
      "hash64": "29452FD7AEE338EC",
      "text": "Does that mean what I think it means...?[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_10",
      "hash64": "401E26BBE39A17F6",
      "text": "Indeed! Team Star can continue to exist, should\\nthat be your wish![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "team_0160_kakutou_03",
      "hash64": "515BA91EB832E9C9",
      "text": "Woo-hoo! Penny, isn’t this great? Now we can all\\nstay together![VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "team_0160_doku_03",
      "hash64": "1D9A2EE70425B524",
      "text": "O, mine heart is giddy with glee![VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "team_0160_botan_03",
      "hash64": "1B1191CD8DCB58AF",
      "text": "B-but...I betrayed all of you...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "team_0160_fairy_01",
      "hash64": "DD5A953A638C2898",
      "text": "You mean Operation Starfall? Director Clavell\\ntold us all about it![VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "team_0160_aku_01",
      "hash64": "294531D7AEE33C52",
      "text": "Far as we heard, you only went through with it\\nto save us from getting expelled!\\c\\nYou were just worried about us, right?[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "team_0160_honoo_01",
      "hash64": "B14C1DB3E42C7C1A",
      "text": "Not like we’d ever chuck the team just ’cause\\nsomeone told us to, after all. Ain’t our style.[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "team_0160_doku_01",
      "hash64": "1D9A30E70425B88A",
      "text": "I cannot even begin to imagine how you must\\nhave fear’d for us, Lady Penny...[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "team_0160_kakutou_01",
      "hash64": "515BA71EB832E663",
      "text": "Sorry for making you worry, B.B. We’re all\\nOK now.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "team_0160_botan_04",
      "hash64": "1B118ECD8DCB5396",
      "text": "But—! Even so...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_11",
      "hash64": "401E27BBE39A19A9",
      "text": "Hold on, everyone. I’ve more to say.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_12",
      "hash64": "401E24BBE39A1490",
      "text": "As previously stated, the requirement for Team\\nStar to disband has been revoked.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_13",
      "hash64": "401E25BBE39A1643",
      "text": "However! There are still some unsettled matters\\nto discuss. Allow me to provide a few examples...[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_14",
      "hash64": "401E2ABBE39A1EC2",
      "text": "Your protracted truancy! Your brazen\\ncustomization of school uniforms![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_26",
      "hash64": "401ABABBE3972A9B",
      "text": "Your unauthorized usage of academy equipment![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_27",
      "hash64": "401AB9BBE39728E8",
      "text": "Your reckless modification and jeopardous\\ndriving of Pokémon-powered vehicles![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_28",
      "hash64": "401AB8BBE3972735",
      "text": "Need I go on? Your flagrant disregard for school\\nrules cannot simply be overlooked![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_15",
      "hash64": "401E2BBBE39A2075",
      "text": "Thus, as punishment, you will all be required to\\nengage in community service.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "team_0160_botan_05",
      "hash64": "1B118FCD8DCB5549",
      "text": "Community...service?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_16",
      "hash64": "401E28BBE39A1B5C",
      "text": "Yes. Specifically, I will be asking you to manage\\nthe STCs.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "team_0160_botan_06",
      "hash64": "1B118CCD8DCB5030",
      "text": "Aaand that stands for...?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_17",
      "hash64": "401E29BBE39A1D0F",
      "text": "The Star Training Centers![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_18",
      "hash64": "401E2EBBE39A258E",
      "text": "They shall be facilities for cultivating Pokémon\\nTrainers’ talents. I plan for the academy to found\\r\\nthem in collaboration with the Pokémon League.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 149,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_19",
      "hash64": "401E2FBBE39A2741",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]The idea came to me when I saw M[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0305)]asteriss\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]\\r\\nbattling\\r\\nh[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0202)]iser\\r\\nway\\r\\nthrough\\r\\nyour bases.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
