      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_25",
      "hash64": "401ABBBBE3972C4E",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]M[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0305)]asteriss [VAR 0x0100(0000)]. Please stop\\nby\\r\\nmy\\r\\noffice\\r\\nlater,\\r\\nif\\r\\nyou would.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
